#, fuzzy
msgid "Migration Guide"
msgstr "迁移指南"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We don't have a ton of big new features in Quarkus 2.13.0.Final but it comes with a ton of small enhancements that should improve your overall experience with Quarkus."
msgstr "在Quarkus 2.13.0.Final中，我们没有太多的大的新功能，但它有大量的小的改进，应该可以改善你对Quarkus的整体体验。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It still comes with some exciting stuff:"
msgstr "它仍然带有一些令人兴奋的东西。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Cross Site Request Forgery (CSRF) prevention filter for RESTEasy Reactive (well, security is not always exciting but being well prepared prevents some unnecessary stressful times)"
msgstr "用于RESTEasy Reactive的跨站请求伪造（CSRF）预防过滤器（好吧，安全并不总是令人兴奋的，但做好充分准备可以防止一些不必要的紧张时间）"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Kafka Client Dev UI"
msgstr "Kafka客户端开发界面"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It is also worth noticing that a lot of work is invested in improving the performances of Quarkus lately and you should see significant performance boosts from release to release in the next few months."
msgstr "还值得注意的是，最近在改善Quarkus的性能方面投入了大量的工作，在接下来的几个月里，你应该看到各版本的性能有明显的提升。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To migrate from 2.12, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.13[our migration guide]."
msgstr "要从2.12迁移，请参考 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.13[我们的迁移指南] 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr "有什么新内容？"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Cross Site Request Forgery (CSRF) prevention filter"
msgstr "防止跨网站请求伪造（CSRF）过滤器"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus now provides a RESTEasy Reactive filter that might help to prevent CrossSite Request Forgery attacks."
msgstr "Quarkus现在提供了一个RESTEasy Reactive过滤器，可能有助于防止跨网站请求伪造攻击。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "RESTEasy Reactive is our default REST layer and is a perfect fit for both reactive and blocking workloads."
msgstr "RESTEasy Reactive是我们默认的REST层，完美地适用于反应式和阻塞式工作负载。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It comes in the form of a new extension and you can find all the details in the link:/guides/security-csrf-prevention[dedicated guide]."
msgstr "它以一种新的扩展形式出现，你可以在 link:/guides/security-csrf-prevention[专门的指南] 中找到所有细节。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Kafka Dev UI"
msgstr "Kafka 开发者界面"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus 2.13.0.Final introduces a brand new Kafka Dev UI.\n"
"It brings several exciting features allowing you to manage your Kafka instance from Dev UI."
msgstr "Quarkus 2.13.0.Final 引入了全新的 Kafka Dev UI。它带来了几个令人兴奋的功能，让你可以从开发用户界面管理你的 Kafka 实例。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Feedback and contributions are very welcome in this area."
msgstr "我们非常欢迎在这方面的反馈和贡献。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完整更新日志"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.13.0.CR1[2.13.0.CR1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.13.0.Final[2.13.0.Final] on GitHub."
msgstr "你可以在GitHub上获得 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.13.0.CR1[2.13.0.CR1] 和 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.13.0.Final[2.13.0.Final] 的完整更新日志。"

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "贡献者"

